  "text": "Took this a few months ago for 6 weeks and felt better!\nCame off it and did well for a few months before the reflux returned.\nBack on Dexilant less than a week\nand I'm a wreck this time.\nHeadaches, DIZZINESS like never before.\nI feel like I'm floating even when I'm laying down and not moving..\nit's very weird.\nTrying to push through as my reflux is gone.\nNot sure yet if this drug is worth the dizziness though.\n",
